### ============================================
### RESERVATIONS - Alle endpoints
### ============================================
### Deze file bevat alle endpoints voor reserveringen.
### Zorg dat je eerst ingelogd bent (auth.rest) om een token te hebben.
### ============================================

### VARIABELEN
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5082
@contentType = application/json

### TOKEN - Vul dit in na login (kopieer uit auth.rest response)
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HIER
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HIER

### ============================================
### GET ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 1. GET ALL - Haal alle reserveringen van ingelogde gebruiker op
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 2. GET ALL ADMIN - Haal alle reserveringen op (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation/all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 3. GET BY ID - Haal specifieke reservering op
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ============================================
### POST ENDPOINTS - CREATE
### ============================================

### 4. CREATE RESERVATION - Maak nieuwe reservering aan
### Let op: Voertuig met dit kenteken moet bestaan en toebehoren aan de gebruiker
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "licensePlate": "AB-12-CD",
  "startDate": "2024-12-25 10:00:00",
  "endDate": "2024-12-25 12:00:00",
  "parkingLotId": 1
}

### 5. CREATE RESERVATION - Reservering voor morgen
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "licensePlate": "XY-99-ZZ",
  "startDate": "2024-12-26 09:00:00",
  "endDate": "2024-12-26 17:00:00",
  "parkingLotId": 1
}

### 6. CREATE RESERVATION - Reservering voor volgende week
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "licensePlate": "AB-12-CD",
  "startDate": "2025-01-01 08:00:00",
  "endDate": "2025-01-01 18:00:00",
  "parkingLotId": 1
}

### ============================================
### PUT ENDPOINTS - UPDATE
### ============================================

### 7. UPDATE RESERVATION - Update reservering (alleen eigen reserveringen)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "licensePlate": "AB-12-CD",
  "startDate": "2024-12-25 11:00:00",
  "endDate": "2024-12-25 14:00:00",
  "parkingLotId": 1
}

### 8. UPDATE RESERVATION - Verplaats naar andere parkeerplaats
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "licensePlate": "AB-12-CD",
  "startDate": "2024-12-25 10:00:00",
  "endDate": "2024-12-25 12:00:00",
  "parkingLotId": 2
}

### ============================================
### DELETE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 9. DELETE RESERVATION - Verwijder reservering
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

